<div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3 text-xs text-[#71717A]">
<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
<span class="space-chip text-[11px]">BAY B-14</span>
<span>Claimed today</span>
</span>
<span class="text-outline-variant hidden sm:inline">|</span>
<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
